    "detailed_description": "Help flightless bird Pip solve puzzles to reach the highest heights and see the top, in this heartfelt, uplifting quest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822950/extras/6d312f226eeaa69369d22118752cdac0.avif?t=1726032871\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A physics-driven, single-player adventure puzzle platformer with a touching story of determination<br></li><li>A colossal, world tree teeming with birds and puzzles<br></li><li>Logic-based difficulty, not all puzzles have a single solution to complete them<br></li><li>Over 1 hour of original music with beautiful orchestrated flute and catchy beats<br></li><li>Eggs</li></ul><br>The task is simple - get to the top - but the various puzzles and traversal of the gigantic tree you call home may not be so straight-forward. You and your wits may be the answer to summitting the tree and proving everyone wrong.<br><br><i>Can you make it to the top of the tree?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822950/extras/dd3ca11f9c679300b04d627096e1e7f3.avif?t=1726032871\" width=600 height=124 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Help flightless bird Pip solve puzzles to reach the highest heights and see the top, in this heartfelt, uplifting quest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822950/extras/6d312f226eeaa69369d22118752cdac0.avif?t=1726032871\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A physics-driven, single-player adventure puzzle platformer with a touching story of determination<br></li><li>A colossal, world tree teeming with birds and puzzles<br></li><li>Logic-based difficulty, not all puzzles have a single solution to complete them<br></li><li>Over 1 hour of original music with beautiful orchestrated flute and catchy beats<br></li><li>Eggs</li></ul><br>The task is simple - get to the top - but the various puzzles and traversal of the gigantic tree you call home may not be so straight-forward. You and your wits may be the answer to summitting the tree and proving everyone wrong.<br><br><i>Can you make it to the top of the tree?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822950/extras/dd3ca11f9c679300b04d627096e1e7f3.avif?t=1726032871\" width=600 height=124 /></span>",
    "short_description": "A flightless bird named Pip wants to prove the world wrong and summit the top of the tree he calls home. Help Pip solve physics-based puzzles and navigate the tree's seemingly endless branches all the way up. Can you make it to the top of the tree?",
